### Local configuration ###
# Holds datasource credentials and the Admin bootstrap password, so it stays
# out of the repository. Copy application.properties.example to
# application.properties and fill in local values (or leave the ${ENV:default}
# placeholders and export the variables instead).
src/main/resources/application.properties
!src/main/resources/application.properties.example